---
---

<section class="service-intro-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">技术硬核实力</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        为什么闪电猫是翻墙出海 <br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">与科学上网的首选安全机场？</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        拒绝拥堵低劣公网中继，闪电猫 SpeedCAT 全面采用顶级专线架构，保障全天候极致响应与纯净访问。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="intro-card glass-card">
        <div class="intro-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#22D3EE" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/>
            <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="intro-title">广深/上海 IEPL 专线通道</h3>
        <p class="intro-desc">
          全节点配置独享 IEPL 国际专线与多路冗余 BGP 中继，不受高峰期骨干网波动影响。即使在敏感时期依然稳如泰山，提供毫秒级低延迟的 <strong>稳定节点</strong>。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="intro-card glass-card">
        <div class="intro-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A855F7" stroke-width="2">
            <polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"/>
            <rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="intro-title">4K/8K 视频原画无缓冲</h3>
        <p class="intro-desc">
          原生 IP 解锁 YouTube、Netflix、Disney+、HBO Max 及 Steam 跨区下载。千兆带宽随意冲浪，拖动 4K/8K 进度条零等待，带给您极致影音体验。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="intro-card glass-card">
        <div class="intro-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#22D3EE" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10H12V2z"/>
            <path d="M12 12L2.5 7.5"/>
            <path d="M12 12v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="intro-title">AI 生产力大模型深度兼容</h3>
        <p class="intro-desc">
          专门优化 OpenAI (ChatGPT)、Claude 3.5、Midjourney 与 GitHub Copilot 的连接规则。解决 IP 封禁与验证码烦恼，助您高效开展科研与创作。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="intro-card glass-card">
        <div class="intro-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A855F7" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/>
            <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="intro-title">Clash / ClashParty 全平台托管</h3>
        <p class="intro-desc">
          一键导出通用订阅地址，无缝支持 <strong>clash节点</strong>、<strong>clashparty机场</strong>、Shadowrocket 及 Surge 客户端，全智能分类自动化分流。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .service-intro-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .intro-card {
    padding: 36px 30px;
  }

  .intro-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(11, 15, 23, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .intro-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .intro-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
